    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It looks like an ordinary football field... but something's buried beneath.</strong><br>Start digging. What you find might change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond the Pitch</strong> is a minimalist digging game about going deeper\u2014underground and into the unknown. No instructions. No map. Just you, the soil\u2026 and a growing feeling that this place hides more than it shows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f What lies beneath:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig. Upgrade. Keep going.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer hides something new.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues, tools, secrets, mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything needs an explanation.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It looks like an ordinary football field... but something's buried beneath.</strong><br>Start digging. What you find might change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond the Pitch</strong> is a minimalist digging game about going deeper\u2014underground and into the unknown. No instructions. No map. Just you, the soil\u2026 and a growing feeling that this place hides more than it shows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f What lies beneath:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig. Upgrade. Keep going.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer hides something new.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues, tools, secrets, mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything needs an explanation.</p></li></ul>",
